# Q48 Is it built as designed: each built object with its design in data-product, the layer it is built in and the layer its design names.
PREFIX tg: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/technical-graph/>
PREFIX dp: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/data-product/>
SELECT ?object ?design ?builtLayer ?designedLayer WHERE {
  ?object tg:designedAs ?design .
  OPTIONAL { ?object tg:layer ?builtLayer }
  OPTIONAL { ?design dp:layer ?designedLayer }
}
